    "show_share": true,
    "description": "For Scarlet Chemarum, a master's degree wasn't just another line on a resume. Having completed her undergraduate studies in Uganda, she had a clear mission: to become a key player in Kenya's dynamic media and communications industry. She knew she needed more than a degree; that's why she chose the Aga Khan University's Graduate School of Media and Communications (GSMC) to pursue a Master of Arts in Digital Journalism. Its stellar reputation and pragmatic, real-world approach were exactly what she needed to bridge her past experience with her future ambitions.",
